---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`Disclaimer for ${site.companyName} (${site.brand}) — the reference nature of our product information, export trade disclaimers, and the limits of our liability.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal">
        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 25 October 2026</p>

        <p>
          This Disclaimer sets out the basis on which <strong>{site.companyName}</strong> (&ldquo;{site.brand}&rdquo;,
          &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) publishes information on{' '}
          <strong>{site.domain}</strong>. Please read it carefully. By using this website, you accept and agree
          to the terms of this Disclaimer.
        </p>

        <nav class="toc" aria-label="Disclaimer contents">
          <strong>Contents</strong>
          <ol>
            <li>General information only</li>
            <li>Product specifications are reference in nature</li>
            <li>Export and trade disclaimer</li>
            <li>Fitment and compatibility</li>
            <li>No professional or technical advice</li>
            <li>External links</li>
            <li>Intellectual property</li>
            <li>Limitation of liability</li>
            <li>No warranty</li>
            <li>Changes to this Disclaimer</li>
            <li>Contact us</li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <h2>1. General information only</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website, including product descriptions, technical articles, specifications,
          figures, photographs and selection guidance, is provided for general information and preliminary
          business-evaluation purposes only. It is directed at professional buyers, importers and distributors
          and is not intended to amount to advice on which you should rely without independent verification.
        </p>
        <p>
          While we make reasonable efforts to keep the information on this website accurate, complete and
          current, we make no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the accuracy,
          reliability, availability or completeness of the content, and any reliance you place on such content
          is strictly at your own risk.
        </p>
        <p>
          The website is updated from time to time and its content may be out of date at any given moment. We are
          under no obligation to update any information, and we do not represent that the website reflects the
          very latest product, pricing or availability state at the time you view it. Always confirm current
          details with us directly before making a decision.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Product specifications are reference in nature</h2>
        <p>
          The specifications, dimensions, materials, filtration-efficiency figures, packaging details, minimum
          order quantities, lead times, certifications and other technical data shown on this website are
          <strong>indicative and reference in nature</strong>. They may be based on representative or seed
          values and are not guaranteed to reflect the exact current production version of any product.
        </p>
        <p>
          The <strong>authoritative specification for any order is the formal specification sheet and the
          confirmed proforma invoice</strong> that we issue for that specific order, as agreed with you in
          writing. In the event of any inconsistency between website content and a formal document, the formal
          document prevails. Before placing an order, you must obtain and verify a current specification sheet
          and, where applicable, a pre-production sample.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where this website states filtration-efficiency percentages, micron ratings, dimensions or other
          performance data, such values should be understood as nominal targets verified against the relevant
          test standard (for example ISO 5011, SAE J726 or ISO 4548, as applicable). Actual performance depends
          on the specific product, its application and the conditions of use.
        </p>
        <h3>2.1 Certification and compliance</h3>
        <p>
          References on this website to certifications, quality-management systems or compliance standards (such
          as ISO 9001, IATF 16949, CE or RoHS) describe the frameworks we operate to and the documentation we
          provide. They are not a guarantee that any particular certificate is current, in scope for a specific
          product, or accepted in your destination market. Specific certification status and test reports are
          confirmed per order, and destination-market approvals are the importer&rsquo;s responsibility to verify.
        </p>
        <h3>2.2 No warranty from website content</h3>
        <p>
          Nothing on this website constitutes a warranty or guarantee of any product&rsquo;s performance,
          merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose. Warranty terms, where they apply, are set out
          solely in the sales contract or proforma invoice for each order, and are subject to the exclusions and
          conditions stated in that document. Website content is not, and should not be treated as, a warranty
          of any kind.
        </p>
        <h3>2.3 Test data and performance figures</h3>
        <p>
          Where this website quotes efficiency percentages, beta ratios, micron ratings or dust-holding figures,
          those values are nominal and refer to laboratory test conditions under the stated standard. Real-world
          performance is influenced by the application, the operating environment, the service interval and the
          condition of the vehicle or machine, and may differ from the nominal figure. Confirm the applicable
          test report and specification for the exact SKU before relying on any performance figure.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Export and trade disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          {site.brand} is an export manufacturer and does not guarantee that any product complies with the
          regulatory, safety, labelling or certification requirements of any particular destination market.
          Importers and distributors are solely responsible for:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Determining that products are suitable and lawful for sale in the destination market;</li>
          <li>Obtaining any necessary import licences, approvals or certifications;</li>
          <li>Complying with all applicable import, customs, tariff, safety, environmental and labelling laws;</li>
          <li>Confirming HS codes, duties and any anti-dumping or trade-restriction measures that may apply.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Information on this website about target markets, HS codes or certifications is provided for general
          guidance only and does not constitute legal, customs or regulatory advice. You should seek independent
          advice from qualified professionals where appropriate.
        </p>
        <h3>3.1 HS codes, duties and tariffs</h3>
        <p>
          HS codes shown on this website are provided as a convenience and are based on our understanding of the
          product classification. They may not reflect reclassification by customs authorities, changes in tariff
          schedules, or the classification applied in a specific destination market. You are responsible for
          confirming the correct classification, duty rate and any applicable anti-dumping, countervailing or
          safeguard measures with the relevant customs authorities before import. We accept no liability for
          duties, tariffs, penalties or delays arising from classification.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Fitment and compatibility</h2>
        <p>
          Automotive filters and related components are fitment-critical. A product that is dimensionally or
          functionally incompatible with a specific vehicle, engine, transmission or housing can fail and, in
          some cases, cause damage. It is your responsibility to confirm that any product you order is correct
          for its intended application, using OE numbers, technical drawings, samples and, where necessary,
          professional fitting guidance. We are not liable for losses arising from incorrect fitment,
          misapplication or use of a product outside its intended application. In particular, a filter that
          does not seat or does not match its engine, transmission or housing can fail without warning.
        </p>

        <h2>5. No professional or technical advice</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing on this website constitutes engineering, legal, regulatory, financial or other professional
          advice. Content is written from a general export and procurement perspective and may not address the
          specific circumstances of your market or application. You should consult appropriately qualified
          professionals before making decisions based on this content.
        </p>

        <h2>6. External links</h2>
        <p>
          This website may contain links to third-party websites or resources. These links are provided for
          convenience only. We have no control over the content of third-party sites and accept no responsibility
          for them or for any loss or damage that may arise from your use of them. A link does not imply
          endorsement.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, the content of this website is owned by or licensed to {site.companyName}
          and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce or distribute it without our
          prior written consent. Third-party trade marks and part numbers mentioned on this website are the
          property of their respective owners and are referenced for identification and cross-referencing
          purposes only; such references do not imply any affiliation or endorsement.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, {site.companyName} and its officers, employees and agents
          shall not be liable for any loss or damage, whether direct, indirect, incidental, special,
          consequential or punitive, arising out of or in connection with your use of, or reliance on, this
          website or its content, including but not limited to loss of profits, revenue, business opportunity,
          data or goodwill. This limitation applies whether the claim is based in contract, tort (including
          negligence), statute or otherwise, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
        <p>
          Nothing in this Disclaimer excludes or limits any liability that cannot be excluded or limited under
          applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>9. No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          This website is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis. We do not
          warrant that the website will be uninterrupted, secure or free from errors or harmful components, and
          we disclaim all warranties to the fullest extent permitted by law. We may modify, suspend or
          discontinue the website or any part of it at any time without notice.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise this Disclaimer from time to time. The &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this
          page indicates when the current version took effect. Your continued use of the website after changes
          are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Disclaimer.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Disclaimer, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> {site.whatsapp}</li>
          <li><strong>Mobile:</strong> {site.mobile}</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> {site.address}</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Related documents: <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a> &middot; <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
